ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641600/extras/562928d11c7b919556b11eb838ce6632.mp4?t=1749059712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641600/extras/a96433c4121d5462513c35e337e714ff.avif?t=1749059712\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641600/extras/3a16bf4d40b930688a809f68ee2873ae.avif?t=1749059712\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641600/extras/a6d4d34c978d76b1840e44e5ab7cbdf4.poster.avif?t=1749059712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641600/extras/a6d4d34c978d76b1840e44e5ab7cbdf4.webm?t=1749059712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641600/extras/a6d4d34c978d76b1840e44e5ab7cbdf4.mp4?t=1749059712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use the map as a weapon</strong> and <strong>don't lose your focus!</strong> Made to be Crushed is a <strong>strategic</strong> and <strong>nervous local multiplayer shooter</strong>. Trap or be trapped! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players in local multiplayer ! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">14 Carefully designed versus maps for great replayability! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strategic game with simple rules and easy to learn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Configurable keyboard and joysticks! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A training mode to play alone or in co-op against bots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
